      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garden_City%2C_Colorado"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally settled as part of the agricultural expansion of northeastern Colorado, Garden City was officially incorporated in 1957.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
